OL,3,GNEWSAFree dental appointment scheme
OL,4,Areaches milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn initiative offering 12,000 free
OL,7,Fdental appointments to people in
OL,8,Fsouth-west England has reached a third
OL,9,Fof its target so far, bosses have said.
OL,11,FSince February, students at the
OL,12,FPeninsula Dental School have seen 4,000
OL,13,Fpeople unable to get an NHS check-up or
OL,14,Fafford to go private, at a new centre
OL,15,Fin Plymouth.
OL,17,FThose in the industry have urged the
OL,18,Fgovernment do more to improve access to
OL,19,FNHS dentistry after the region was
OL,20,Fidentified as having the worst coverage
OL,21,Fin the country.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
