OL,3,GNEWSAFree dental appointment scheme
OL,4,Areaches milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCare said it had made changes to expand
OL,8,Fdental school places, offer more dental
OL,9,Ftreatment, and prioritise those
OL,10,Fpatients most in need.
